      "claim": "L3 oral exposure records for close benzamide/morpholine analogs (moclobemide-like Tmax ~1.4 h; procainamide steady-state oral AUC/Cmax) demonstrate oral absorption in humans, consistent with, but not proof of, F ≥ 20%.",
