  "decision_summary": "Predicted high (F ≥ 20%) with moderate confidence. The closest analog sematilide (47–59%) and morpholine-containing references (44–100%) support F ≥ 20%; all transferable measured values are above 20%, and the only sub-20% value (linezolid in mice) is not transferable. L3 oral exposure records for close analogs are consistent with oral absorption but do not provide direct F; modified-release formulation adds uncertainty but no affirmative low-F evidence."
}

